@startuml

title Multimodal Input Communication Protocol

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

[*] --> Inactive : Subscribe to\n<ROBOT_BASE_TOPIC>/PERCEPTION

state Inactive

state Active {
    Active : do / collect and process\nmodality-specific data
}

state Finalizing {
    Finalizing : process collected data
    Finalizing : produce final CAT or VAD observation
    Finalizing : publish to\n<ROBOT_BASE_TOPIC>/PULSE/INPUT
}

' ============================================================
' INACTIVE
' ============================================================

Inactive --> Active : START\n[source_id in sources]

Inactive --> Inactive : START\n[source_id not in sources]

Inactive --> Inactive : END

' ============================================================
' ACTIVE
' ============================================================

Active --> Active : START / ignore

Active --> Finalizing : END

' ============================================================
' FINALIZATION
' ============================================================

Finalizing --> Inactive : publication completed

note right of Inactive
The module remains subscribed
to PERCEPTION while inactive.
end note

note right of Active
Data acquisition and processing
continue while the module remains
in this state.

The sensing technology and
processing procedure are
implementation-specific.
end note

note right of Finalizing
The collected data are processed
using an implementation-specific
procedure.

Exactly one final CAT or VAD
observation is published for
the completed perception window.
end note

@enduml